      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C774CC28C6D00020BBF8B974002E002E002E000AC8800020B3540020ADF8B7F4C2F8D55C0020ACF3C77C0020C21C0020C5C6C5C8B3580020AC70C57C003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "평범한 상가 건물 같은 게...\n현실의 미르에 있는 기분이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3C9BC94D55C0020C0C1AC000020AC74BB3C0020AC19C7400020AC8C002E002E002E000AD604C2E4C7580020BBF8B974C5D00020C788B2940020AE30BD84C774B124C694002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 일인데?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C77CC778B370003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빚을 갚을 수 있게\n팁을 주셨던 일 있잖아요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n아직 제대로 감사하다는 말을 못 드려서요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE5AC7440020AC1AC7440020C2180020C788AC8C000AD301C7440020C8FCC168B3580020C77C0020C788C796C544C694002E00100001BE00000AC544C9C10020C81CB300B85C0020AC10C0ACD558B2E4B2940020B9D0C7440020BABB0020B4DCB824C11CC694002E00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빚을 갚을 수 있게\n팁을 주셨던 일 있잖아요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n아직 제대로 감사하다는 말을 못 드려서요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE5AC7440020AC1AC7440020C2180020C788AC8C000AD301C7440020C8FCC168B3580020C77C0020C788C796C544C694002E00100001BE00000AC544C9C10020C81CB300B85C0020AC10C0ACD558B2E4B2940020B9D0C7440020BABB0020B4DCB824C11CC694002E00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "돈을 빚지는 것은\n목숨을 빚지는 것과 마찬가지!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n우리는 서로 대등해야 한다고 생각했으니까\n행동으로 옮겼을 뿐이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C8C7440020BE5AC9C0B2940020AC83C740000ABAA9C228C7440020BE5AC9C0B2940020AC83ACFC0020B9C8CC2CAC00C9C0002100100001BE01000AC6B0B9ACB2940020C11CB85C0020B300B4F1D574C57C0020D55CB2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D588C73CB2C8AE4C000AD589B3D9C73CB85C0020C62EACBCC7440020BFD0C774C57C002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그보다도, 이렇게 모인 김에\n우리와 승부하지 않겠어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8BCF4B2E4B3C4002C0020C774B807AC8C0020BAA8C7780020AE40C5D0000AC6B0B9ACC6400020C2B9BD80D558C9C00020C54AACA0C5B4003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이죠!\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, 너도 괜찮지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C8E00021000A0010000201000000002C0020B108B3C40020AD1CCC2EC9C0003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이죠!\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, 너도 괜찮지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C8E00021000A0010000201000000002C0020B108B3C40020AD1CCC2EC9C0003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이지!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C9C000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어쩌지...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4CA4CC9C0002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨를 너무 기다리게 하지는 마.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528B97C0020B108BB340020AE30B2E4B9ACAC8C0020D558C9C0B2940020B9C8002E00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨를 기다리게 해서\n좋을 건 없을 거야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528B97C0020AE30B2E4B9ACAC8C0020D574C11C000AC88BC7440020AC740020C5C6C7440020AC70C57C002E002E002E00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MZ단의 리더와 비밀 병기가 함께라면\n천하무적이라구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D005AB2E8C7580020B9ACB354C6400020BE44BC000020BCD1AE30AC000020D568AED8B77CBA74000ACC9CD558BB34C801C774B77CAD6CC694002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MZ단의 리더와 비밀 병기가 함께라면\n천하무적이라구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D005AB2E8C7580020B9ACB354C6400020BE44BC000020BCD1AE30AC000020D568AED8B77CBA74000ACC9CD558BB34C801C774B77CAD6CC694002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "펜드라가 자랑스러워할 만한 사내이고 싶어.\n승부해 줄 거지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D39CB4DCB77CAC000020C790B791C2A4B7ECC6CCD5600020B9CCD55C0020C0ACB0B4C774ACE00020C2F6C5B4002E000AC2B9BD80D5740020C9040020AC70C9C0003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 믿음직한 사람이라는 것을\n카라스바 님께 다시금 보여 드리고 싶습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020BBFFC74CC9C1D55C0020C0ACB78CC774B77CB2940020AC83C744000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8AED80020B2E4C2DCAE080020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACE00020C2F6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러지 말고 빨리 승부를 시작하자고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECC9C00020B9D0ACE00020BE68B9AC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D558C790ACE0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번에야말로 울려 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC88C5D0C57CB9D0B85C0020C6B8B8240020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 강철 같은 마음은 동요하지 않습니다.\n얼마든지 기다려 드리죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020AC15CCA00020AC19C7400020B9C8C74CC7400020B3D9C694D558C9C00020C54AC2B5B2C8B2E4002E000AC5BCB9C8B4E0C9C00020AE30B2E4B8240020B4DCB9ACC8E0002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 님의 체면도 있으니\n일절 봐드리지 않겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8C7580020CCB4BA74B3C40020C788C73CB2C8000AC77CC8080020BD10B4DCB9ACC9C00020C54AACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨가 기다리고 있으니까\n빨리 포켓몬 승부를 시작하자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528AC000020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C73CB2C8AE4C000ABE68B9AC0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D558C790002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨가 기다리고 있으니까\n빨리 포켓몬 승부를 시작하자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528AC000020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C73CB2C8AE4C000ABE68B9AC0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020C2DCC791D558C790002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "펜드라! 너와 함께라면\n지금 이 상황도 웃으며 돌파할 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D39CB4DCB77C00210020B108C6400020D568AED8B77CBA74000AC9C0AE080020C7740020C0C1D669B3C40020C6C3C73CBA700020B3CCD30CD5600020C2180020C788C5B4002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화를 통한 유대...\n무장조의 아름다움을 보여 드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020D1B5D55C0020C720B300002E002E002E000ABB34C7A5C870C7580020C544B984B2E4C6C0C7440020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 있기에\n우리는 한계를 초월할 수 있다고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020C788AE30C5D0000AC6B0B9ACB2940020D55CACC4B97C0020CD08C6D4D5600020C2180020C788B2E4ACE0002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 있기에\n우리는 한계를 초월할 수 있어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020C788AE30C5D0000AC6B0B9ACB2940020D55CACC4B97C0020CD08C6D4D5600020C2180020C788C5B4002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨와의 승부...\n어쩐지 얼얼한 느낌이 든단 말이지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528C640C7580020C2B9BD80002E002E002E000AC5B4CA50C9C00020C5BCC5BCD55C0020B290B08CC7740020B4E0B2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 씨와의 승부...\n어쩐지 얼얼한 느낌이 든단 말이지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020C528C640C7580020C2B9BD80002E002E002E000AC5B4CA50C9C00020C5BCC5BCD55C0020B290B08CC7740020B4E0B2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "과연 ZA로열 TOP 2는 다르군.\n우리의 연계도 더 다듬을 필요가 있겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACFCC5F00020005A0041B85CC5F400200054004F005000200032B2940020B2E4B974AD70002E000AC6B0B9ACC7580020C5F0ACC4B3C40020B3540020B2E4B4ECC7440020D544C694AC000020C788ACA0C5B4002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저의 실력이 부족한 탓에...\n이런 결과가 나오게 되어 면목 없습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C7580020C2E4B825C7740020BD80C871D55C0020D0D3C5D0002E002E002E000AC774B7F00020ACB0ACFCAC000020B098C624AC8C0020B418C5B40020BA74BAA90020C5C6C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지프 넌 충분히 잘하고 있어.\n매번 고맙게 생각하고 있다고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0D5040020B10C0020CDA9BD84D7880020C798D558ACE00020C788C5B4002E000AB9E4BC880020ACE0B9D9AC8C0020C0DDAC01D558ACE00020C788B2E4ACE0002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "현실 미르에서도 매번 보는 사이니\n빠르게 마무리할까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D604C2E40020BBF8B974C5D0C11CB3C40020B9E4BC880020BCF4B2940020C0ACC774B2C8000ABE60B974AC8C0020B9C8BB34B9ACD560AE4C003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 옷을 줄게!\n대신 부탁이 하나 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C637C7440020C904AC8C0021000AB300C2E00020BD80D0C1C7740020D558B0980020C788C5B4002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n카라스바 코디 슈트 세트를 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000010000219000001000ACE74B77CC2A4BC140020CF54B5140020C288D2B80020C138D2B8B97C0020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MZ단과 우리가 요즘 좀...\n가깝게 지내는 일이 많았잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D005AB2E8ACFC0020C6B0B9ACAC000020C694C9980020C880002E002E002E000AAC00AE5DAC8C0020C9C0B0B4B2940020C77CC7740020B9CEC558C796C544002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 녹청파는 강에서 튀어나온\n잉어킹을 강바닥에 처박아 주고<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n탈피 중인 아보의 껍질을 벗겨 버리는\n살벌한 집단이라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020B179CCADD30CB2940020AC15C5D0C11C0020D280C5B4B098C628000AC789C5B4D0B9C7440020AC15BC14B2E5C5D00020CC98BC15C5440020C8FCACE000100001BE01000AD0C8D53C0020C911C7780020C544BCF4C7580020AECDC9C8C7440020BC97ACA80020BC84B9ACB294000AC0B4BC8CD55C0020C9D1B2E8C774B77CACE0002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리에게도 체면이라는 게 있으니\n조심해 줬으면 좋겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC5D0AC8CB3C40020CCB4BA74C774B77CB2940020AC8C0020C788C73CB2C8000AC870C2ECD5740020C92CC73CBA740020C88BACA0C5B4002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이러니저러니 해도\n미르시티는 내가 자란 곳이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7ECB2C8C800B7ECB2C80020D574B3C4000ABBF8B974C2DCD2F0B2940020B0B4AC000020C790B7800020ACF3C774C57C002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보스로 변장해서 일반인들을 놀라게 하면\n가만히 있지 않을 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C2A4B85C0020BCC0C7A5D574C11C0020C77CBC18C778B4E4C7440020B180B77CAC8C0020D558BA74000AAC00B9CCD7880020C788C9C00020C54AC7440020AC81B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부는 정말\n멋진 것 같지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B2940020C815B9D0000ABA4BC9C40020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AC544003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부는 정말\n멋진 것 같지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
